    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n41774" root="وخز" body-key="w">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَخْزٌ</span></b>  The <i>plague;</i> syn. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">طَاعُونٌ</span>. (TA.) See
above. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <i>Pain:</i> [or, app., <i>a piercing,</i> or <i>pricking, pain:</i>] as in the following ex.: <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">إِنِّى لَأَجِدُ</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فِى يَدِى وخْزًا</span> [<i>Verily I feel, in my arm,</i> or
<i>hand, a pain,</i> or <i>a piercing,</i> or <i>pricking, pain</i>].
(IAar, TA.)

